            "text": "{\n  \"proposals\": [\n    {\n      \"rationale\": \"Link exemption C0004 to affected substantive requirements in this section (C0000, C0001, C0002) by changing relation to exception and updating qualifies.\",\n      \"operation\": \"edit\",\n      \"target\": \"C0004\",\n      \"qualifies\": [\"C0000\", \"C0001\", \"C0002\"],\n      \"quote\": \"(2) This section does not apply to:\\n\\n(i) Retail facilities;\\n\\n(ii) Oil or gas well drilling or servicing operations; or,\\n\\n(iii) Normally unoccupied remote facilities.\",\n      \"fields\": {\n        \"concepts\": [],\n        \"claimants\": [],\n        \"typed_values\": [],\n        \"effective_periods\": [],\n        \"defined_terms\": [],\n        \"term_refs\": [],\n        \"kind\": \"exemption\",\n        \"scope_quotes\": [],\n        \"scope_text\": \"\",\n        \"context_quotes\": [],\n        \"modality_quote\": \"\",\n        \"modality\": \"not_required\",\n        \"alternative_quotes\": [],\n        \"choice_quote\": \"\",\n        \"choice_text\": \"\",\n        \"logic_text\": \"\",\n        \"actor_quote\": \"\",\n        \"actor\": \"\",\n        \"action_quote\": \"\",\n        \"action\": \"\",\n        \"object_quote\": \"\",\n        \"object\": \"\",\n        \"jurisdiction_quote\": \"\",\n        \"jurisdiction\": \"\",\n        \"relation\": \"exception\",\n        \"references\": [],\n        \"summary\": \"Section 1910.119 does not apply to retail facilities, oil or gas well drilling or servicing operations, or normally unoccupied remote facilities.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"observations\": [\n    {\n      \"quote\": \"(1) This section applies to the following:\\n\\n(i) A process which involves a chemical at or above the specified threshold quantities listed in appendix A to this section;\\n\\n(ii) A process which involves a Category 1 flammable gas (as defined in 1910.1200(c)) or a flammable liquid with a flashpoint below 100 °F (37.8 °C) on site in one location, in a quantity of 10,000 pounds (4535.9 kg) or more except for:\\n\\n(A) Hydrocarbon fuels used solely for workplace consumption as a fuel (e.g., propane used for comfort heating, gasoline for vehicle refueling), if such fuels are not a part of a process containing another highly hazardous chemical covered by this standard;\\n\\n(B) Flammable liquids with a flashpoint below 100 °F (37.8 °C) stored in atmospheric tanks or transferred which are kept below their normal boiling point without benefit of chilling or refrigeration.\",\n      \"rationale\": \"General positive application conditions and thresholds governing section applicability remain unmodeled as claims in this draft.\",\n      \"disposition\": \"unresolved\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
